  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-26T00:45:58.717Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The mic icon already lights up when you speak. I find the grow/shrink animation to be visually distracting, much more so than the flashing or even the old mic icon. Especially since this thing plays a lot talking on VRChat. It would be very nice if there was at least an accessibility option to disable this. In my opinion it would make the HUD more comfortable. Thanks",
